      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Man aye lok ma giciko, ki lwak cik ki gin ma Rwot oŋolo ma Rwot Lubaŋawu ocika ni apwonywu kwede, wek wulubgi i lobo ma wubicito loka ca ka camone, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wek wulwor Rwot Lubaŋawu, wun kikomwu ki likwayowu, kun wugwoko cikke ducu ki lok ducu ma en ociko ma atye ka cikowu kwede, nino ducu me kwo mewu, wek wuri i wi lobo pi kare malac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi meno, wun jo Icrael wuwiny, wugwokke wek wulubgi, wek nyimwu obed leŋ, wek wunya bene mapol, kit ma Rwot Lubaŋa pa kwarowu yam owaco botwu i lobo ma mol cak ki moo kic-ci.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
