            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I kare ma Rwot Lubaŋawu doŋ otyeko kelowu i lobo ma yam okwoŋo pire bot kwarowu Abraim ki Icaka ki Yakobo, ni ebimiyowu, ma tye iye gaŋi madito ma gibeco, ma yam pe wun aye wugerogi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki odi ma gupoŋ ki jami ducu ma gibeco ma yam pe wun aye wupoŋo igi, ki bur pii ma gikwinyogi ma pe wun aye wukwinyo, ki poto olok ki poto jeituni ma pe wun aye wupito; ka doŋ wucamo wuyeŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci ber wugwokke wek wiwu pe owil woko i kom Rwot ma yam okwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, i ot me opii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 4.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 4.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wulwor Rwot Lubaŋawu, wuti pi en, wukwoŋ kwoŋwu ki nyiŋe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wulub kor lubaŋa mukene ducu, macalo lwak lubaŋa pa rok mapatpat ma birumowu dyere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pien Rwot Lubaŋawu ma tye i kinwu-ni en Lubaŋa ma lanyeko; wek kiniga pe omak Rwot Lubaŋawu i komwu, miyo en bityekowu woko liweŋ ki i wi lobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
